@startuml sequence_task_create_v2
title シーケンス図: タスク作成 (POST /api/tasks) - BFF経由・Feature Flagによるv1/v2分岐

actor "ブラウザ(React)" as Browser
participant "bff: auth middleware" as AuthMW
participant "bff: csrf middleware" as CsrfMW
participant "bff: proxy/task_route.go" as Proxy
participant "bff: featureflag evaluator" as Flag
participant "backend v1 (REST)" as V1
participant "backend v2 (gRPC)" as V2
database "MySQL" as DB

Browser -> AuthMW : POST /api/tasks\n(Cookie: session_id, Header: X-CSRF-Token)
AuthMW -> AuthMW : Redisからaccess_token取得
AuthMW -> CsrfMW : 検証OK
CsrfMW -> Proxy : リクエスト委譲
Proxy -> Flag : Evaluate("bff.tasks-backend-v2", targetingKey=user_id)

alt Flag = OFF (旧実装)
  Proxy -> V1 : POST /internal/v1/tasks (Authorization: Bearer)
  V1 -> V1 : JWT検証(authjwt)
  V1 -> DB : INSERT tasks / INSERT task_labels
  V1 --> Proxy : 201 Task(JSON, v1形状)
else Flag = ON (新実装)
  Proxy -> V2 : TaskService.CreateTask (metadata: authorization)
  V2 -> V2 : JWT検証(interceptor)
  V2 -> DB : INSERT tasks / INSERT task_labels (Preloadで整合)
  V2 --> Proxy : Task(protobuf, v2形状)
end

Proxy -> Proxy : v1/v2いずれのレスポンスも共通JSON形状へ変換
Proxy --> Browser : 201 { id, name, ..., labels: [...] }

note over Proxy, V2
  Reactはbackendがv1/v2どちらで処理したか一切意識しない。
  BFFが下流プロトコル差異(REST/gRPC)とレスポンス形状差異を吸収する。
end note
@enduml
